<title>UK: T&amp;N sells Tenmat for 18.1 mln stg in MBO.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N sells Tenmat for 18.1 mln stg in MBO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group T&amp;N Plc has sold its Tenmat Ltd high performance engineering materials group for 18.1 million stg in a management buy-out, Tenmat said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tenmat, based in Manchester, has turnover of over 18.4 million stg and more than 300 staff internationally, the company said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
